@name kick
$onlyPerms[kick;❌ You need the Kick Members permission.]
$onlyIf[$mentioned[1]!=;Mention someone to kick.]
$kick[$mentioned[1];$noMentionMessage]
👢 Kicked <@$mentioned[1]>.
---
@name purge
$onlyPerms[managemessages;❌ You need Manage Messages.]
$argsCheck[1;Usage: `$prefixpurge 10`]
$deleteCommand
🧹 Deleted **$clear[$message[1]]** messages.
